Upstream and downstream jobs:
-----------------------------
    upstream job - triggers another job
    downstream job - get triggered automatically

    Example Flow:
    ------------
        Dev job --> QA job --> Prod job

    Why use it:
    -----------
        - automates pipeline flow
        - avoids manual triggering
        - ensures order of execution

    In pipeline script:
    -------------------
        instead of GUI triggers:
            build job: 'QA-Job'